# Email Service Configuration
# ===========================
# Required for email sending functionality

# Resend API Key
# Get from: https://resend.com/api-keys
# Format: re_xxxxxxxxxxxxx
RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_api_key_here

# Sender Email Address
# Optional - defaults to noreply@campaign.local
# For production, use your domain: noreply@yourdomain.com
SENDER_EMAIL=noreply@campaign.local

# ===========================
# Setup Instructions:
# 
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local
# 2. Replace the placeholder values with your actual credentials
# 3. Restart your development server
# 4. Test email sending from Admin Dashboard
#
# For detailed setup instructions, see:
# - EMAIL_SETUP_GUIDE.md
# - ADMIN_EMAIL_SYSTEM.md
# ===========================
